# Stack Header Reader ABI1: d0 target IC housing, d1 optional Setting mirror.
poke 0 31416067
poke 1 1
poke 2 20
poke 5 1
poke 7 0
Loop:
yield
poke 5 4
move r0 0
move r1 0
move r2 0
move r3 0
move r4 0
move r5 0
move r6 0
move r8 0
move r9 0
move r14 -1
bdnvl d0 ReferenceId Publish
l r2 d0 ReferenceId
l r7 d0 PrefabHash
beq r7 HASH("StructureCircuitHousing") TargetReady
beq r7 HASH("StructureCircuitHousingCompact") TargetReady
move r14 -2
j Publish
TargetReady:
poke 5 2
move r14 -5
get r0 d0 0
mod r13 r0 1
bnez r13 Publish
beqz r0 Publish
move r14 -6
get r1 d0 1
mod r13 r1 1
bnez r13 Publish
blez r1 Publish
get r8 d0 2
mod r13 r8 1
bnez r13 Publish
bltz r8 Publish
bgt r8 31 Publish
and r13 r8 1
beqz r13 SchemaDone
get r3 d0 3
mod r12 r3 1
bnez r12 Publish
beqz r3 Publish
SchemaDone:
and r13 r8 4
beqz r13 StateDone
get r5 d0 5
mod r12 r5 1
bnez r12 Publish
bltz r5 Publish
bgt r5 5 Publish
StateDone:
and r13 r8 8
beqz r13 TelemetryDone
get r6 d0 6
mod r12 r6 1
bnez r12 Publish
blt r6 8 Publish
bgt r6 511 Publish
TelemetryDone:
and r13 r8 16
beqz r13 GenerationDone
get r9 d0 7
mod r12 r9 1
bnez r12 Publish
bltz r9 Publish
GenerationDone:
and r13 r8 2
beqz r13 HeaderReady
get r4 d0 4
mod r12 r4 1
bnez r12 Publish
blt r4 8 Publish
bgt r4 508 Publish
get r12 d0 r4
bne r12 31416054 Publish
add r10 r4 1
get r12 d0 r10
bne r12 1 Publish
add r10 r4 2
get r12 d0 r10
mod r11 r12 1
bnez r11 Publish
blt r12 4 Publish
bgt r12 192 Publish
add r10 r4 3
get r11 d0 r10
beqz r11 ExtensionBound
bne r11 1 Publish
blt r12 5 Publish
ExtensionBound:
add r10 r4 r12
bgt r10 512 Publish
HeaderReady:
move r14 3
Publish:
poke 9 r0
poke 10 r1
poke 11 r8
poke 12 r3
poke 13 r4
poke 14 r5
poke 15 r6
poke 16 r9
poke 17 r2
poke 8 r14
get r13 db 7
add r13 r13 1
poke 7 r13 # complete header sample publishes LAST
bdnvs d1 Setting Loop
s d1 Setting r0
j Loop
